5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,We need to make sure this works in the yards. I'll check the yard devices and the peak-season cutover.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I'm worried about the long-term budget. I'll look into the board minutes and the renewal invoices.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Accountability is key. I want to see the support ownership during the outage and the warehouse rule changes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'll check the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the 2018 pay move data lift.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,The human element is most important. I will examine administrator retirements and the depot supervisors' last rollout.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, do you think the board minutes will show if they'll actually pay for the hardware I need?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Possibly, Kenji. I want to see where the money actually goes after the initial contract is signed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, your choices on technical debt align well with my concerns about the plan matching the business.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Thanks, Asuka! I just don't want us to buy something that breaks the moment we stop paying the consultants.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,It is wise to look at the ghosts of projects past to guide our future.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
